<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">gemini2k Tools (<strong>gemini2k.co.kr</strong>, “this site”) values your privacy and explains below how personal information is handled.</p>
    <p class="upd">Effective date: June 25, 2026 · This English version is a translation for convenience; if it differs from the Korean original, the Korean version prevails.</p>

    <h2>1. Core principle — your input is not sent to our server</h2>
    <p>All tools on this site (character counting, unit and coordinate conversion, image and PDF processing, de-identification, etc.) run only inside your browser. Text, files, coordinates and other data you enter or upload are not sent to or stored on this site’s server, and results remain only on your device.</p>

    <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>This site has no sign-up and does not collect information that directly identifies you, such as your name or contact details. However, the following information may be collected and used automatically to operate and improve the service and to display ads.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Statistics such as visit history, page views, device and browser type, and approximate region (Google Analytics)</li>
      <li>Advertising identifiers via cookies and similar technologies (advertising partners such as Google AdSense)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>To keep this site free, we may show third-party ads such as Google AdSense. The following applies.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site and other websites.</li>
      <li>Google may use advertising cookies (such as the DART cookie) to provide interest-based ads.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of personalized ads in <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, and opt out of third-party vendors’ use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings, although some features may be limited.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For more on how Google uses advertising and cookies, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google’s advertising policies</a>.</p>

    <h2>4. Visit analytics (Google Analytics)</h2>
    <p>This site may use Google Analytics to analyze visit statistics. Google Analytics collects non-identifying statistics through cookies, and you can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>5. Sharing with third parties and retention</h2>
    <p>Because this site does not collect or store your input data, it does not provide it to third parties. Information collected for statistics and advertising is processed and retained under the policies of the service providers named above, such as Google.</p>

    <h2>6. External links and external data</h2>
    <p>Some tools (maps, coordinates, GIS, etc.) may call external map or data services such as OpenStreetMap and VWorld. The privacy policies of those services apply to their processing. This site is not responsible for how personal information is handled after you follow an external link.</p>

    <h2>7. Children’s privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not primarily directed at children under 14 and does not knowingly collect children’s personal information.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>This policy may be revised in line with changes in law or in the service, and any changes will be announced on this page.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about how personal information is handled, please contact us below.</p>
